{"unit_id": "173787247__dsh-wsl-compose#card-zh", "repo": "173787247/dsh-wsl-compose", "commit": "74e45460af17962e11a3546b5c87989b9242730f", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-wsl-compose 是 DSH 的 Docker Compose 工具插件，可查询项目状态、查看服务列表和日志，并按需启停项目。它注册 compose_status、compose_ps、compose_logs、compose_up 和 compose_down；日志支持服务筛选并限制输出长度。启停默认关闭，须启用 allowMutate 并逐次明确确认。适合在 WSL 中管理 Compose 项目的开发者，本机需安装 Docker Compose。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:21-39", "index.js:41-101", "index.js:103-120", "lib/compose.js:88-126"]}
